TangoQ
======

TangoQ is a fork of Mixxx (https://mixxx.org), purpose-built for Argentine
Tango DJs.

Mixxx is Copyright (C) 2001-2026 the Mixxx Development Team and is licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later. See the LICENSE
file for the full license text and upstream notices, which are preserved
intact.

TangoQ modifies Mixxx. All TangoQ fork changes are Copyright (C) 2026
Seemanta Dutta (TangoQ) and are distributed under the same license
(GNU General Public License, version 2 or later). Adding this notice does
not change the license: TangoQ is GPL v2-or-later, exactly as Mixxx is.

The individual TangoQ changes are not stamped file by file across the many
upstream source files they touch. Instead, the complete set of fork changes
can be reviewed in the project's Git history relative to the upstream Mixxx
2.5.6 release this fork is based on:

    git log 2.5.6..HEAD

Source files that are original to TangoQ (added by the fork rather than
modified from upstream) carry a TangoQ copyright header.

TangoQ is not affiliated with, supported by, or endorsed by the Mixxx
project. Please report problems with TangoQ to its own issue tracker at
https://github.com/seemantadutta/tangoq/issues, not to the Mixxx project.
